<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: DETAILS OF CZECH STATS BUREAU 1997-8 ECON FCASTS.</title>
<headline>DETAILS OF CZECH STATS BUREAU 1997-8 ECON FCASTS.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are economic</p>
<p>indicator estimates for the Czech Republic for 1997 and 1998,</p>
<p>as released by the Czech Statistical Bureau on Friday.</p>
<p> Indicator			Actual		Estimated</p>
<p>				  1995  1996	 1997	   1998</p>
<p> Gross Domestic Product    4.8   4.4     2.9 - 3.5    4.0 - 5.0</p>
<p>Of this:</p>
<p> Household consumption     6.4   6.0     4.0 - 5.0    5.0 - 6.5</p>
<p> Public sector consump.   -4.3   1.9    -0.5 - 1.5    0.0 - 1.0</p>
<p> Fixed capital formation  16.1  12.4     5.0 - 7.0    6.0 - 8.5</p>
<p>Industrial output</p>
<p> Production of goods	8.7   6.8     3.0 - 5.0    4.0 - 6.0</p>
<p> Selected products index  n/a   4.0     1.5 - 3.0    2.5 - 4.0</p>
<p>Trade</p>
<p> Imports			10.3  3.5     4.5 - 6.5    7.0 - 10.0</p>
<p> Exports			28.6 12.7     7.5 -10.5    7.0 - 10.0</p>
<p>Trade balance</p>
<p> in mln of crowns	  -95.7 -159.8  190.0-200.0 -200.0-220.0</p>
<p>Current account</p>
<p> in billions of crowns    -36.2 -121.5   -130-135    -130-140</p>
<p> in bln USD		    -1.4  -4.5    -4.3-4.5    -4.2-4.5</p>
<p> as a pct of GDP	     -2.9  -8.6    -8.2-8.6    -7.3-7.8</p>
<p> Average inflation	   9.1  8.8     8.2 - 8.8    8.8 -  9.8</p>
<p> Industrial prices	   7.6  4.8     4.4 - 5.0    4.7 -  5.5</p>
<p> Nominal industrial wages 17.5 18.0    14.0 -15.5   13.0 - 15.0</p>
<p> Average real wages	  7.7  8.5     5.4 - 6.2    3.9 -  4.7</p>
<p> Unemployment		  2.9  3.5     3.6 - 4.0    4.0 -  5.0</p>
<p>Note. All figures are expressed in real, percentage terms,</p>
<p>except where otherwise noted.</p>
<p>-- Alan Crosby, Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
